<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS4" title="In Appendix B Methodology ‣ Protocode: Prototype-Driven Interpretability for Code Generation in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.4 </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Code Completion prompts</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS5" title="In Appendix B Methodology ‣ Protocode: Prototype-Driven Interpretability for Code Generation in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.5 </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Analysis</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Protocode: Prototype-Driven Interpretability for Code Generation in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation Study</span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
