</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#A1.SS3.p3.1" title="A.3 In context learning ‣ Appendix A Related Works ‣ Protocode: Prototype-Driven Interpretability for Code Generation in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§A.3</span></a>.
</span></li>
<li id="bib.bib36" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_inproceedings"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhang <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2022)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">Y. Zhang, S. Feng, and C. Tan</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">Active example selection for in-context learning</span>.
</span>
