</div></li>
</ul>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_end_3_columns"></div>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span><span id="A5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLM usage</span></h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">LLM was used to improve the quality of writing, and to assist in the LaTeX code review; it was not used during the ideation or experimentation phase.</p>
</div>
</section>
